1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,943
Meet CUE. The producer for solo streamers.

2
00:00:04,593 --> 00:00:08,481
Type one line. Pick a vibe.

3
00:00:09,131 --> 00:00:13,019
CUE drafts your run of show. Edit anything.

4
00:00:13,669 --> 00:00:19,574
Connect Twitch. Connect OBS. Stage the overlay.

5
00:00:20,224 --> 00:00:24,111
Going live? Always your call.

6
00:00:24,761 --> 00:00:31,675
Chat wants a challenge. CUE spots the pattern, checks your rules, and makes the call.

7
00:00:32,325 --> 00:00:36,212
And it's on stream. Verified.

8
00:00:36,862 --> 00:00:41,254
Every cue shows its receipts.

9
00:00:41,904 --> 00:00:46,296
Pause it. Restyle it. Rate-limit it.

10
00:00:46,946 --> 00:00:50,330
Then grab your recap and export it.

11
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:55,130
CUE. Your stream, right on cue.
